        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoka wakatamba nyama yonso yakafuka Yehowa Nzambi bidimu. Nyoka wakakonka mukashi ne, Nzambi wakamba ne, Kanudi mamuma a nu tshi yonso idi mu budimi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukashi wakambila nyoka ne, Tudi mua kudia mamuma a mitshi yonso idi mu budimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi mamuma a mutshi udi munkatshi mua budimi, Nzambi wakamba ne, Kanuadi, kanualengi, bua kanufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyoka wakambila mukashi ne, Kanuena nufua bulelela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua Nzambi udi mu manye ne, Hanuadia mamuma au, mesu enu neabuluke, nenuikale bu Nzambi, nenumanye malu mimpe ne malu mabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamona mukashi ne, Mutshi au udi muimpe wa kudia ne udi muimpe ku mesu ne udi mua kuha muntu lungenyi, yeye wakangata dimuma, wakadia, wakahesha mulume wandi kabidi, ne yeye wakadia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu a bubidi buabo akabuluka, bakamanya ne, Tudi butaka, bakatela mabeshi a nfigi, bakadienzela mbondia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakunvua di dia Yehowa Nzambi wendakana mu budimi dilolo, mulume ne mukashi bakasokoma munkatshi mua mitshi ya mu budimi ku mesu kua Yehowa Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa Nzambi Wakabikila mulume, wakamukonka ne, Wewe udi kudi kunyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Nakunvua di diebe mu budimi, nakutshina, bualu bua nakadi butaka, nakusokoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne, Wakakuambila ne, Udi butaka nganyi? Wakudia mamuma a mutshi unakukuambila ne, Kudi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulume wakamba ne, Mukashi uwakumpa bua kuikala nʼanyi wakumpa dimuma dia mutshi, nakudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa Nzambi wakambila mukashi ne, Bualu ebu buwakuenza budi tshinyi? Mukashi wakamba ne, Nyoka wakundinga, nakudia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa Nzambi wakambila nyoka ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
